// The system's prelude (vault designs/policy-language-draft-2026-11-08.md §2): the facts coordd supplies and the
// decisions it asks. Not policy: the facts are filled from the proxy and the price catalog (coordd policy/facts.rs).
Fact model Identified by String
Fact provider Identified by model * String
Fact family Identified by model * String
// the agent harness that runs the model in a session: codex (OpenAI's models), claude (Anthropic's)
Fact harness Identified by model * String
// input price, micro-dollars per million tokens (cpa's resources/model_prices.json); a model without one is not used
Fact price Identified by model * Int

// The model of an LLM call. The call gives `task` (its `task` line), `agent` (who it runs for) and `call` (its name).
Decision model-for
  Options model
  Requires price(option) >= 0

// A net's session is a harness session (owner m116): its model must be one a harness runs. The call gives
// `place` = `session` for a session's first call.
Only for model-for When call.place == "session":
  harness(option, _)

// The team (coordd supplies these for every norm query, policy/norms.rs): each agent, its role (`coord role`; an agent
// given none is a member), the mail thread a query is about ("none" outside a thread), and the agents the owner wrote to
// in that thread.
Fact agent Identified by String
Fact role Identified by agent * String
Fact thread Identified by String
Fact brought-in Identified by agent * thread

// Teams and model tiers (vault designs/teams-and-tiers-2026-11-10.md §3), supplied for every norm query: each agent's
// model (its effort suffix dropped), its parent (none for the owner's own), a team grant (N agents allowed, U added so
// far) and whether it was added to a team. The proxy's `model` and `family` facts are supplied to the norms too.
Fact runs Identified by agent * model
Fact parent Identified by agent * agent
Fact granted Identified by agent * Int
Fact used Identified by agent * Int
Fact member Identified by agent
